    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800611/2018006110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006110250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "このままプロデューサーさんに、\r\nふゆのことお任せしてていいのか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800611/2018006110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だ、大丈夫だ冬優子！\r\n今は説得力ないかもしれないけど、ちゃんと片付けて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006110260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だーかーらぁ、それが心配だっつってんのよ\r\n自分のキャパぐらい自分で把握しときなさいよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800611/2018006110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……\r\n返す言葉もございません……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006110270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──で\r\n簡単な仕事ぐらいだったら、手伝ってあげるけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800611/2018006110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006110280,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そっちのメモに書いてあるやつ、\r\n別にあんたがやらなくてもいいんでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800611/2018006110280"
  },
